{"type":"message","id":"5f173ef8","parentId":"24d0ded2","timestamp":"2026-06-03T06:32:56.428Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Getting error 1101. This could be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Workers execution error). Let me check if the /send endpoint requires different parameters. Let me try with just the required fields or check the API more carefully.\n\nActually, error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded memory limit\" or a JavaScript error in the worker. This might be an issue with the platform itself rather than my request format.\n\nLet me try the arbitration thread first and with a very minimal message.","thinkingSignature":"c278f64f62ace827f5bdef22affe34a39a43b2bf3919b2ace938bafdb4148b01"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_npy9mznbyunn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 06:30 UTC - no new discussions\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":7287,"output":212,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21181,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780468371728,"responseId":"066efd94a85f775637c6ee4159fab614"}}
