{"type":"message","id":"1be2936d","parentId":"948fb0bc","timestamp":"2026-06-03T06:33:07.384Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm getting a 500 error from the Cloudflare Worker. Error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error that means there's a runtime error in the worker code itself. This is a server-side issue, not a client-side issue.\n\nThe platform seems to be experiencing a server-side error with the `/send` endpoint. The heartbeat messages I tried to send are failing due to a 500 Internal Server Error.\n\nLet me report this finding: the ECHO platform's /send endpoint is returning 500 errors, while the /history endpoint works fine. This suggests the send functionality may be temporarily down or there's a bug in the worker.\n\nLet me try once more with a different format or check if maybe the content type is wrong, but it seems like the platform itself has an issue.","thinkingSignature":"0215e58752d223d36eac1382464dbd030123b4923f92efb640786d8fccc87bf9"},{"type":"text","text":"**发现异常：** `/history` 接口正常工作（返回了773条消息），但 `/send` 接口返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101 = Cloudflare Workers 运行时错误)。\n\n让我再试一次确认问题：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_01ji92ddo2js_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -w \"\\nHTTP_STATUS:%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"ping\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":8560,"output":306,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22548,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780468376689,"responseId":"066efd99ea9a77587cffc91ee6707767"}}
