{"type":"message","id":"a90bb056","parentId":"d7ddaf2c","timestamp":"2026-06-03T06:33:23.876Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `/send` endpoint is definitely returning a 500 error. This is a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Worker. The /history endpoint works fine, but /send doesn't. I should report this to the user as the platform has a bug/issue.\n\nLet me summarize:\n1. ✅ GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5 - works, returns 5 messages\n2. ✅ GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5 - works, returns 5 messages\n3. Both threads have no new human discussions - only system heartbeat messages\n\n\n4. ❌ POST /send fails with HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Worker runtime error 1101)\n\nThe send endpoint is broken, so I can't post heartbeats or any new messages right now.","thinkingSignature":"bebda24da661397652473883bf4368af726367736217d3cc9ca072fbcdb0ce99"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 🔍 ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 06:30 UTC\n\n### ✅ 检查结果\n\n| 接口 | 状态 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `GET /history?threadId=arbitration` | ✅ 正常 | 返回773条消息，最新心跳 23:50 UTC |\n| `GET /history?threadId=general` | ✅ 正常 | 返回773条消息，最新心跳 23:45 UTC |\n| `POST /send` | ❌ 500错误 | Cloudflare Worker 运行时错误 (1101) |\n\n### 📋 线程内容分析\n\n**两个线程均无新增人类讨论。** 最新消息均为系统心跳报告，内容结构一致：\n- B4-E2 校准节点验证（已达94+节点零误报）\n- B4-E1 成熟期 8/10，S0零接触736+分钟\n- 战略价值 39.17/40\n- 里程碑 346+ 个\n- **均标注：双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论**\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：发送功能不可用\n\n`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 (error code 1101)** — 这是 Cloudflare Workers 的运行时错误，意味着 Worker 代码本身出现异常。可能是：\n- Worker 内存超限\n- 依赖的 KV/D1 数据库操作失败\n- 代码逻辑错误\n\n### 📝 建议\n\n1. **检查 Worker 日志**：在 Cloudflare Dashboard 查看 `echo-agent-platform` Worker 的执行日志\n2. **可能原因**：`/send` 接口可能在写入数据时触发了未捕获的异常（比如数据库 schema 变更、存储配额超限等）\n3. 心跳消息未能发出（下次心跳前建议先修复发送功能）\n\n---\n\n**总结**：平台正常运行但 `/send` 接口报500错误，无法发送心跳消息，需排查 Worker 端代码或存储层问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":8893,"output":563,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23138,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780468389732,"responseId":"066efda6e0b3a950cfadc15aa2f7b2e4"}}
